{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "情绪水平一致", "content": "情绪水平一致是指与孩子情绪同步：孩子在哭、你在笑就不是同一情绪水平；孩子兴奋时你也因为他的兴奋而兴奋，孩子悲伤时你也难过，这样才叫同等的情绪水平。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪水平", "高质量陪伴"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-6f1cf2842956-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-6f1cf2842956", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-6f1cf2842956-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "身体水平一致", "content": "身体水平一致是指陪伴时身体与孩子处于同一高度，避免高高在上，以便实现高质量陪伴。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["身体水平", "高质量陪伴"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-6f1cf2842956-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-6f1cf2842956", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-6f1cf2842956-c001:u0005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "认知水平一致", "content": "认知水平一致是指用孩子能理解的方式交流，不超出其认知范围。孩子懂的不多，如果孩子问“我从哪里来”时讲生育科学，孩子很快就累、烦，陪伴就不会高质量；孩子说好朋友是蜘蛛侠时，不要否定，而要顺着他的想象回应，例如问“蜘蛛侠长什么样子啊？蜘蛛侠带你到哪里玩啦？蜘蛛侠有没有带你飞到外太空去呀？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["认知水平", "高质量陪伴"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-6f1cf2842956-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-6f1cf2842956", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006", "b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-6f1cf2842956-c001:u0006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "高质量陪伴的要素：排外", "content": "高质量陪伴的第二个要素是排外：全身心投入，排除外界打扰，包括其他孩子和配偶也不能打扰。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["排外", "高质量陪伴"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-6f1cf2842956-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-6f1cf2842956", "blocks": ["b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-6f1cf2842956-c001:a008", "kind": "supports", "condition": "单独约会是实现排外的一种方式", "reason": "a007提出排外要素，a008建议单独约会来达到排外", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-6f1cf2842956-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
